exports[`files beside the report MANIFEST 1`] = `
"format: video-to-prompt/2
source: handback — Checkout total
recorded: 2026-10-15 14:02 | 1 part(s) | http://localhost:4810
note: every path below is relative to this walkthrough
--- files ---
report.md              the whole walkthrough in order, on one timeline. read this one
MANIFEST.txt           this listing
rec-01/                part 1 — 31s, 7 spoken line(s)
rec-01/frames/         10 keyframes, NN-mmss.jpg (the mmss is time inside this part's own video.webm, not a position in report.md's timeline) — a candidate every 250 ms (webcodecs), 125 examined
rec-01/grids/          2 contact sheet(s), 9 frames each, in order, changes outlined in magenta
rec-01/transcript.txt  Whisper large-v3 (Groq) — NOT checked by the speaker; treat wording as approximate
rec-01/recording.json  frame times, change boxes, spoken line windows, 1 error(s)
rec-01/video.webm      raw video (for humans)
note: line stamps are where the speaker started; the bracketed range is the window the line covers
--- transcript: rec-01 (0:31) ---
[0:01–0:03] This is the checkout page for a single order.
[0:05–0:06] Saving shows a toast that disappears fast.
[0:08–0:11] Look at the total, it says 1,240 but the line items add up to 1,180.
[0:16–0:18] The coupon field still throws a validation error even with a valid code.
[0:19–0:21] The shipping modal opens fine.
[0:27–0:29] Hovering the info icon shows a tooltip.
[0:29–0:31] And that's where it ends up.
"
`;

